commit 2ee4087da90a2bdfdef40e220512d98a8b917a7b
Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Mon Oct 12 19:05:11 2026 +1100

    WIP / PoC: Support image digests in kolla_container.
    
    With Docker, kolla_container splits a digest reference such as
    repository@sha256:<hex> at the colon inside the digest, and looks for
    it only in RepoTags, so it can neither pull the image nor match it.
    The Docker worker now splits it at the "@" and checks RepoDigests.
    
    The Engine API takes a digest wherever it takes a tag, so the digest is
    passed as the tag. The shared parse_image is unchanged, because
    podman-py rejoins the repository and tag with a colon, so Podman
    already works.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context, high effort) <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context, high effort) <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    Change-Id: If0363f9d97763b1fe5f74c1596074e76b91ef4cd
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

